# Build artifacts. The PDFs are the deliverable; these are what makes them.
#
# Not committed because they are large (framebuffer PNGs and plate renders run
# to megabytes) and because they are DERIVED -- transcript_*.sh and the emulator
# regenerate them. Ignored rather than merely uncommitted so a rebuild cannot
# leave 20 untracked PNGs sitting in `git status`, which is how a 1 MB shots/
# nearly rode along in an unrelated commit.
out/
shots/
